  "question": {
    "text": "A stationary source is emitting sound at a fixed frequency <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>f</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>, which is reflected by two cars approaching the source. The difference between the frequencies of sound reflected from the cars is <math> <mrow> <mn>1.2</mn><mo>%</mo></mrow> </math> of <math> <mrow> <msub> <mi>f</mi> <mn>0</mn> </msub> </mrow> </math>. What is the difference in the speeds of the cars (in <math> <mrow> <mtext>km</mtext></mrow> </math> per hour) to the nearest integer ? The cars are moving at constant speeds much smaller than the speed of sound which is <math> <mrow> <mn>330</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup> <mrow> <mtext>ms</mtext></mrow> <mrow> <mtext>-1</mtext></mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math>.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "7",
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> be the velocities of sources, then apparent frequencies are<br /><br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></math><br /><br />Then difference between frequencies is,<br /><br /><math><mo>∆</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>∆</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfrac><msub><mrow><mi>f</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∵</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mtext> </mtext><mo>&amp;</mo><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mfenced><mi>c</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mo>∆</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>.</mo></math>",
    "image": null
  },
